        <canvas class="season__map" data-season-map aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
        <canvas class="season__seam" data-season-seam aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
        <div class="season__scrim" aria-hidden="true"></div>

        <div class="season__content">
          <div class="season__grid">
            <div>
              <p class="season__eyebrow">season_2026 &nbsp;//&nbsp; rounds 01&ndash;12</p>
              <h2 class="season__head" data-text="words" data-stagger="90" data-config="REVEAL" data-mode="forward" data-delay="120">the season so far</h2>
              <div class="season__copy">
                <p data-text="words" data-stagger="14" data-config="COPY_SLOW" data-mode="forward" data-delay="320" data-gap="0.28">Twelve rounds in. Three podiums, one front row, and a car that has finally stopped fighting him through the slow corners.</p>
                <p data-text="words" data-stagger="14" data-config="COPY_SLOW" data-mode="forward" data-delay="520" data-gap="0.28">The rookie brief was simple: finish races, learn the tyre, keep the car out of the wall. He has done all three and then started taking points off the front of the grid.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <dl class="season__rows">
              <div class="season__row"><dt>best finish</dt><dd><em>P2</em></dd></div>
              <div class="season__row"><dt>quali avg</dt><dd>P6.4</dd></div>
              <div class="season__row"><dt>laps led</dt><dd>41</dd></div>
              <div class="season__row"><dt>championship</dt><dd>P5</dd></div>
            </dl>
