          <p data-text="words" data-stagger="12" data-config="COPY" data-mode="forward" data-delay="200" data-gap="0.28">Silverstone was the first weekend the car did exactly what the simulator said it would. We started sixth, ran a long first stint on the hard, and came out of the stops in clean air with eleven laps of tyre in hand.</p>
          <p data-text="words" data-stagger="12" data-config="COPY" data-mode="forward" data-delay="360" data-gap="0.28">The pass for third happened at Stowe on lap forty-four. Nothing clever about it. Just a car that finally rotates on entry and a driver who has stopped apologising for the space he takes.</p>
